{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 46, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.2-3b-instruct", "content": "Fair traveler to Japan's shores thou seekest an itinerary most fine\nDay one thou shalt arrive at Tokyo's Narita or Haneda airport\nTake train or bus to thy hotel and rest thy weary head\nNext morning thou shalt venture forth to Shibuya's famous scramble\nWalk the busiest street in Tokyo and marvel at the crowds that throng\n\nThence to Tokyo's Asakusa thou shalt journey to Senso-ji's revered gate\nShop for knick-knacks and snacks in the nearby Nakamise market's stalls\nVisit Ueno Park's gardens and admire the beauty of nature's handiwork\nAnd in the evening watch the sunset over Tokyo's towering spires\n\nDay three thou shalt travel to Nikko a city of ancient temples and shrines\nVisit Toshogu Shrine a UNESCO World Heritage site of great renown\nSee the stunning Futarasan Shrine and marvel at the beauty of the land\nAnd in the evening return to Tokyo to rest and prepare for the next day's quest\n\nDay four thou shalt depart for Kyoto the city of temples and geisha\nVisit Kinkaku-ji Temple a golden temple of beauty and of fame\nWalk the Arashiyama Bamboo Grove and marvel at nature's gentle might\nAnd in the evening stroll along Gion's famous street and see the geisha's gentle light\n\nDay six thou shalt visit Nara's Todai-ji Temple a shrine of ancient peace\nSee the Great Buddha whose wisdom and kindness shall bring thee release\nVisit Kasuga-taisha Shrine a Shinto shrine of great beauty and of old\nAnd in the evening return to Kyoto to rest and prepare for the next day's journey\n\nDay eight thou shalt travel to Hiroshima and visit the Hiroshima Peace Memorial\nLearn of the city's tragic history and the devastating power of war's might\nWalk the Peace Boulevard and see the Atomic Bomb Dome's haunting sight\nAnd in the evening return to Osaka to rest and prepare for the next day's delight\n\nDay ten thou shalt visit Osaka's famous Osaka Castle a fortress of great renown\nLearn of the city's history and the bravery of its defenders\nWalk the castle's moats and see the city's beauty from a new perspective\nAnd in the evening stroll along the Dotonbori River and see the city's vibrant light\n\nAnd thus thy journey through Japan's land of the rising sun shall come to an end\nMay thy travels be filled with wonder and thy heart be filled with joy and love", "logprobs": [{"token": "Fair", "logprob": -0.005423000548034906}, {"token": " traveler", "logprob": -0.008865046314895153}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -1.5360031127929688}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.0017610769718885422}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.32050859928131104}, {"token": " shores", "logprob": -4.452241897583008}, {"token": " thou", "logprob": -0.09042414277791977}, {"token": " see", "logprob": -0.1924336850643158}, {"token": "kest", "logprob": -2.52720492426306e-05}, {"token": " an", "logprob": -1.9770232439041138}, {"token": " itinerary", "logprob": -0.008179854601621628}, {"token": " most", "logprob": -0.1655936986207962}, {"token": " fine", "logprob": -0.3668171167373657}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.18471017479896545}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.787061870098114}, {"token": " one", "logprob": -0.020198142156004906}, {"token": " thou", "logprob": -1.8723827600479126}, {"token": " shalt", "logprob": -0.0032620809506624937}, {"token": " arrive", "logprob": -0.4765738248825073}, {"token": " at", "logprob": -1.3671678304672241}, {"token": " Tokyo", "logprob": -0.04966995120048523}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.0004642124113161117}, {"token": " Nar", "logprob": -0.870732843875885}, {"token": "ita", "logprob": -7.510157047363464e-06}, {"token": " or", "logprob": -0.3600189983844757}, {"token": " Han", "logprob": -0.0003880701260641217}, {"token": "eda", "logprob": -3.099436753473128e-06}, {"token": " airport", "logprob": -0.022589271888136864}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.12146031111478806}, {"token": "Take", "logprob": -0.8629372119903564}, 